      "grass_clearance": 0.05,
      "_doc": "the circuit edge (ledger 0078): no curb, no sidewalk. The asphalt edge is held at road height for 0.30 m and the run-off ground meets it 0.15 m lower over 1.0 m [invented: the flush meet the drive gate reads as no drop]; the ground beyond is the assembler's conform to the road, then the 3DEP surface: the real run-off level."
    },
    "seat_edges_grade_pct": 5.0,
    "_seat_edges_grade_doc": "ledger 0083: the measured (uncapped) profile turns hard where the estimated line crosses the planted banks of Jimmy Durante Blvd (25 % over 10 m); engine-july's 3 m edge shelf chorded 0.7 mm over the lane there (drive_test ground on top 2, s 1,099). The line's points steeper than 5 % [invented: the lots read ~1 %, the banks 8-37 %] get seat_edges' fine cut, as a bank of atan(grade) would (tools/seat_edges_grade.py)"
