  "_name_doc": "The event was the Camel Grand Prix of Southern California (1987-88), Nissan Grand Prix of Southern California (1989), Grand Prix of Greater San Diego / Vons Grand Prix of San Diego (1990-92). Kevin to name; 'Del Mar Grand Prix' is the placeholder.",
  "ui_description": "ESTIMATED layout. The 1987-92 IMSA Camel GT temporary street circuit through the Del Mar Fairgrounds lots, San Diego County: its shape from the period TV map, placed on today's ground inside the envelope the 1987 ESPN broadcast aerials allow (about 2.0 km against the published 2.57 km). Not traced from any survey of the course: no drawing to scale survives. Counter-clockwise. Real USGS 3DEP elevation. Built on Lake Murray's engine. Not an official or endorsed product.",
